    "bodyText": "US | English\nShop new arrivals\n95054\nEast Palo Alto, CA\nProducts\nRooms\nDeals\nDesign & ideas\nServices\nHej! Log in or sign up\n3\nProducts\n›\nStorage & organization\n›\nStorage solution systems\n›\nBESTÅ storage system\n› BESTÅ sideboards　›　BESTÅ Storage combination with doors\nAll media\n↪　View in 3D\nIKEA Family price\nBESTÅ\nStorage combination with doors, black-brown Lappviken/Stubbarp/brown walnut effect, 47 1/4x16 1/2x29 1/8 \"\n$197.00\n17% off, save $43.00\nRegular price: $240.00\nPrice valid Oct 7, 2026 - Nov 11, 2026 or while supply lasts\n★★★★★(123)\nKnobs and handles are sold separately.\nChoose color\nBlack-brown Lappviken/Stubbarp/brown walnut effect\n+12\nDesign it yourself\nCustomise BESTÅ in our planning tool\n↗\nHow to get it\nIn stock in IKEA East Palo Alto, CA\n\nOpens at 10:00 AM\nFind in store\n\nClick and collect at IKEA East Palo Alto, CA\n\nFrom $2.00 or Free with IKEA Family\n\nHome delivery to 95054\nAdd to bag\nAvailable services\n\nHave your BESTÅ professionally assembled for $58.50. Learn more\n\n♢\nCollect 197 points with IKEA Family\nJoin for free or log in | Explore what you can get\nIt's OK to change your mind ♡\nReturn within 365 days for a full refund*. Learn more\nLow Price Guarantee　♧\nPrice drops? Get the difference back within 90 days with IKEA Family\nMore ways to pay\n▣ Afterpay\n4 interest-free payments of $50.00 + tax\nIKEA Visa Credit Card　▤\nEarn 5% in rewards at IKEA using the IKEA Visa Credit Card*.\nOverview\nProduct details\nMeasurements\nWhat's included\nA simple storage solution that fits your home\n\nEverything you need for storing and keeping things organized at home. Choose a ready-made combination or create your own, adapted to your style and belongings. This is just one of many, many possibilities.\n\nProduct details\n⌄\nGood to know\n⌄\nMaterials and care\n⌄\nSafety & compliance\n⌄\nAssembly and documents\n⌄\nCustomer reviews\n3.7\n★★★★★\n\nAverage rating\n\n123\n\nReviews\n\nShow all reviews\nAccessories for BESTÅ\n×\n3.7\n★★★★★\n\nBased on 123 reviews\n\n5 ★\n54\n4 ★\n30\n3 ★\n10\n2 ★\n12\n1 ★\n17\nAppearance\n●●●●　 4.3\nEase of assembly/installation\n●●●●　 3.9\nProduct quality\n●●●●　 3.5\nValue for money\n●●●●　 3.6\nWorks as expected\n●●●●　 3.7\nWrite a review\nCustomer reviews\n☷　Filter\n↓☷　Sort by\nUnited States\nOther countries\nReviews summary　♧\nHide summary\n\nBESTÅ offers a stylish design that enhances many spaces. Customers often report issues with overall stability and quality. They mention wobbly structures and difficulty aligning or securing doors. Assembling the door components often proves difficult, impacting functionality. BESTÅ provides a modern, adaptable look for living spaces.\n\nAI-generated summary of actual customer reviews.\nHelpful?　☞　☟\nTopics ♧\nShow all\nQuality (11)\nAssembly (11)\nComponents (10)\nStability (10)\nDesign (10)\nDurability\n★★★★★　⌄\n09/17/2026\nLooks good, functions bad\n\nThe flimsy wood for the frame and plastic cam locks seriously degrade the quality of the overall product. The doors very easily misalign if the cabinet is nudged in any way. As soon as you go to open it, put something on top of it or take it off, the whole cabinet frame shifts, and the doors become misaligned. Not worth the price- this is weak sauce.\n\nDylan\nReport\nHelpful? (1)\n\nResponse from IKEA: - 09/20/2026\n\nOh no, we’re sorry to hear this! You’re welcome to visit our Returns Desk within 180 days of the purchase date.\n\n★★★★★　⌄\n09/12/2026\nGreat storage\n\nThe storage looks good in our living room. Assembly and door alignment took some time.\n\nIKEA customer\nReport\nHelpful? (4)\n★★★★★　⌄\n08/28/2024\nStorage combination\n\nA modern look with plenty of room for our things.\n\nAnonymous reviewer\nReport\nHelpful? (2)"
